{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/9l8fldvg88cyvlbjcmpneih339b6a3c.mp3","text":"放心吧老板，不论在哪儿我都是您生命安全的保障！对了对了，每次行动前要扫一下这里的码，别忘记哟~","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/71mu76owtslly6adc360alkncu1mujz.mp3","text":"努力工作，赚取报酬，都是为了提升自己的生活品质嘛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/8ibs192ac6fx6s6tm1ouny618zrqujy.mp3","text":"大家的装备都在闪闪发光！好想摸一下啊～","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/k157n0vnep6rmv5zf31oum9jh0mw2ux.mp3","text":"我最喜欢新装备了！无论是看到什么都好想买下来啊。就这样，我陷入了无止境的购物漩涡......","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/4alq6lrzumwjrxn4n97230jq9g4b4v6.mp3","text":"为了补贴每个月的花销，我会经常搜集些货物，做点小生意！当然，可都是些物美价廉的好东西哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/9kdbdo3snwuen42h2r2uoij9trc2fig.mp3","text":"这也是运货，那也是运货，既然都是运货，我当然更愿意搬运些好用的东西，或者美味的食物！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/sedoolrzgj6yiib52x1l3xap13qaom2.mp3","text":"老板老板，我找到了特别好吃的东西哦！来尝尝看吧？哼哼，除了装备之外，我可最喜欢美味的食物了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/koncnqhgi53o1awzfs20k29gxbpdxji.mp3","text":"老板！要不要来看看我刚进的一批货？潮款服装，日用工具，办公用品，武器装备，应有尽有哦！买的越多，折扣越大哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/k9iftuwv71xrl9nd1klfb8qhppowo1p.mp3","text":"老板，谢谢您！为我介绍了这么多的工作！托您的福，以前买不起的东西，现在我都负担的起啦！您是最好的老板！最喜欢您了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/s03a9kc4dfwll9exphv216bw0wioxin.mp3","text":"哎呀~这个月也完蛋了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/nmutyjec8k615kw8oxa733ueow1sz5v.mp3","text":"我是可颂。老板您的运气可真好，能得到我这样安全可靠刀枪不入的优质干员！另外，现在雇佣我的话，还可以给您打八折哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/7tc935qahksq98e3uw6jqw4dpib8cj8.mp3","text":"变强的话，就能接到更多工作了吧~","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/km6nmp1glu8oo29ev2ec3nu5kn6wvax.mp3","text":"多亏了老板，我才能得到这么好的岗位，太感谢您了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/luk36je0r5d4ga5ph2wuh52ildgb7sc.mp3","text":"老板老板，您发的奖金，我可没有乱花哦。快看快看，这些都是用来保护您的新装备！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/rxsfa58bgm01cty9c7a1rtupaber7uo.mp3","text":"防卫就交给我吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/gw0ej0cezi2q48d6da48fam4l5v3b4d.mp3","text":"大家！让我们漂漂亮亮地完成这次工作吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/k7vp9ryy2zsk3v0t28i1x06qjwm87i6.mp3","text":"一定给老板一个您满意的战果！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/sc5zdu97kaqn0yp78f70nsbpmauygl2.mp3","text":"敌人给咱们送装备来了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/9sbbv4fbeee27ihzcvpv2vc5jyzdm2v.mp3","text":"什么什么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/9x2b3783yne28yzabbse811gly167m6.mp3","text":"让我试试新装备吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/2ytwkukdbfly0fusucwwaqf756vuf5u.mp3","text":"嘿咻！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/32/2dpchc1lm4ix7n5303covty3e3n0780.mp3","text":"到了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/h4w9v9lu73py2dtu7o48qlnngc3a9fh.mp3","text":"停下！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/81/6xp8e2ud8v5x2s5ygintgtit2v057q7.mp3","text":"此路不通！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/41/0cm82ioxqlo2g16z3kb0uxjwr7i7utb.mp3","text":"雷霆一击！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/mzxofhd94dlehubp8smlxg9ss923tvk.mp3","text":"这招对我没用！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/fvy5b0i7ajamhydif79t6n04hjxzakk.mp3","text":"敌人有没有掉落宝箱什么的呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/7sgslmtwgiol32g1v2fczr3zauoyvd7.mp3","text":"耶～任务完成！","alt":"voice_cn/char_201_moeshd/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/460b0ccq3a07iekibgpximhywuawf4e.mp3","text":"欸，敌人逃跑了，我的业务信誉又要下跌啦......